      "path": ".cg-docs/solutions/git-workflows/2026-10-15-publish-before-wiki-compound.md",
      "slug": "2026-10-15-publish-before-wiki-compound",
      "status": "",
      "summary": "An earlier Compound capture correctly skipped wiki enrichment because `wiki/_wiki.yml` did not exist. The user then requested a precise sequence: commit/push the completed feature, initialize the wiki, and run Compound again. Two different states must remain explicit: the implementation already published to Git, and the wiki/knowledge files generated afterward. A successful first push cannot certify that later files were committed or published. A project `wiki/` folder is also not an automatically published GitHub Wiki site.",
